Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:09.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that paulownia wood case was a mummified left paw.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.80,0:00:16.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru received it from her late mother, and the first time she used it was in fourth grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.93,0:00:19.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to run fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.27,0:00:27.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru had just transferred to a new school after her parents' deaths, but she didn't fit in with her new class
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.98,0:00:29.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and was often teased for being a slow runner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.86,0:00:35.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She thought that maybe if she got first place at the athletic meet that was going on nearby,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.37,0:00:37.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,everyone would see her in a different light. {given the font, this may/may not exceed 2 lines}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.12,0:00:40.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With that in mind, she made her wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.27,0:01:06.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A monster attacked the four other students who were in the race with Kanbaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.48,0:01:11.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The next day, all four of them were absent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.32,0:01:16.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru soon found Jacobs's "The Monkey's Paw", {http://gaslight.mtroyal.ca/mnkyspaw.htm}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.37,0:01:20.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and the terrifying contents of the story made her tremble.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.51,0:01:33.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thinking about it normally, in order to cancel the first wish, she'd have to wish on the mummified paw again. {normally/rationally?}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:38.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But after researching the mummy, she grew scared,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.31,0:01:43.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,because she didn't know how the second wish would be granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.52,0:01:44.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The next day at practice,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.23,0:01:52.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it turned out that she would be running with five other students, all different from the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.28,0:01:55.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.16,0:01:57.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I poured my heart into getting faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.28,0:02:02.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was plain as day that if I didn't do something, something else might happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.46,0:02:08.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru didn't join the track team.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.46,0:02:13.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not knowing how long her wish on the Monkey's Paw would be effective,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.93,0:02:18.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,she couldn't put herself in a situation where there could be people faster than her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.99,0:02:43.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,186)}One day after hearing about my reputation, Senjougahara-senpai came to the gym.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.91,0:02:50.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was the track team's ace, so she came to see me since I had a reputation for being fast. {"Being the track team's ace, she was curious about my reputation as a fast runner,"}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.88,0:02:56.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She challenged me to a 100-meter race, saying it was fine since it was off the record.{"and she challenged me to a 100-meter race, saying it was fine since it was off the record."}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.59,0:03:00.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Though it was really hard, I had no choice but to turn her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.47,0:03:04.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was a wonderful upperclassman.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.39,0:03:14.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It wasn't love at first sight, but after talking with her for three days, I started liking her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.69,0:03:18.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was healed by Senjougahara-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.07,0:03:23.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After that, Kanbaru was able to stop thinking about the mummified paw.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.87,0:03:29.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But even still, she would occasionally feel an urge to use it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.96,0:03:33.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When she played against a fierce rival in basketball.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.55,0:03:37.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When she had heated arguments with friends.\NAnd...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.55,0:03:40.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I was rejected by Senjougahara-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.68,0:03:44.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In the end, I didn't use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.68,0:03:48.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was then that I came to understand that my mother gave me the mummified paw
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.44,0:03:55.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fscx95}because she wanted me to become the type of person who could overcome any obstacle with my own strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.86,0:03:59.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why Kanbaru shut up and distanced herself from Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.24,0:04:07.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She may have been able to solve Senjougahara's problem by wishing on the paw, but she didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.37,0:04:13.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But a year later, Kanbaru found out about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.59,0:04:16.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She saw me at Senjougahara's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.43,0:04:33.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru no longer knows when she took the paw out of the paulownia wood box.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.27,0:04:37.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It never even occurred to her why the paw,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.78,0:04:43.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,which should have only extended to the wrist, had grown all the way to the elbow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.16,0:04:45.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And before she knew,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.03,0:06:44.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun,\Nyoung lady...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.24,0:06:50.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that I understand the whole situation, what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.54,0:06:53.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.16,0:06:56.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, Araragi-kun. I'm a pretty good specialist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.33,0:07:04.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm more than willing to pretend to be a half-assed authority and help you out of this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.34,0:07:06.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-Will you save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.72,0:07:09.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't save you. I'll only lend you a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.85,0:07:13.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The only one who can save you is you yourself, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.10,0:07:18.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But really, Araragi-kun, what am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.40,0:07:19.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oshino...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.73,0:07:24.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, what am I supposed to do to help out this time, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.40,0:07:30.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,First and foremost, there are two simple ways to handle this phenomenon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.83,0:07:34.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One is to let the Rainy Devil kill you, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.79,0:07:36.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The other is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.50,0:07:42.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to simply cut off that monstrous left arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.72,0:07:47.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Cut it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.38,0:07:49.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you just cut off the demon parts?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.59,0:07:51.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will her normal arm grow back afterward?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.18,0:07:54.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not a lizard's tail, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.39,0:07:56.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing's that convenient, wouldn't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.89,0:08:02.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What I'm saying is that an arm is a small price to pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.48,0:08:07.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's great and all, but it'd be pretty inconvenient for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.24,0:08:10.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're trying to kill someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.70,0:08:13.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that a fair price?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.45,0:08:16.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get what you're trying to say, but hold on, Oshino!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.12,0:08:20.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Killing someone isn't what Kanbaru wished for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.42,0:08:23.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru just wants to be at Senjougahara's{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.75,0:08:26.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Just wants to be at her side?" Don't make me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.01,0:08:29.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sure are nice, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.84,0:08:32.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So nice it makes me sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.39,0:08:37.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You seriously believe her mushy crap of an excuse, "I just want to be by her side?"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.31,0:08:40.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you saying... that's not it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.15,0:08:45.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you find it strange, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.23,0:08:49.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do you think it is that when she was in elementary school, her left hand didn't make her faster,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.03,0:08:53.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but instead did something like beating up those around her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.82,0:08:56.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.79,0:09:00.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,doesn't the Monkey's Paw grant wishes in a way that conflicts with the owner's intentions?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.00,0:09:02.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it isn't the Monkey's Paw.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.96,0:09:07.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Rainy Devil is a lesser demon, but a contract is a contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.09,0:09:12.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If she wished to be faster, normally she would just get faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.51,0:09:16.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does beating down her classmates make her faster?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.22,0:09:19.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you find that rather strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.10,0:09:21.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.94,0:09:23.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did a monster in a raincoat come after her classmates?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.19,0:09:26.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd bet that's because the young lady {\i1}wanted{\i0\fscx140} {\r}to beat them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.07,0:09:31.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was having a hard time just after her parents died,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.95,0:09:34.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and she was being bullied by her classmates,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.49,0:09:37.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so it's not very strange for her to have thoughts of revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.62,0:09:39.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.83,0:09:44.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course, I think you were unconscious when you wished for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.38,0:09:48.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In your own consciousness, you really did wish to be faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.55,0:09:50.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that's just the surface; deep inside is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.88,0:09:55.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hidden beneath your wish was the dark desire to beat up your classmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.14,0:10:02.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Though it was unconscious, young lady, I think you should've known very well what really happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.56,0:10:07.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you didn't want to admit it, so you went looking for a different explanation for what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.48,0:10:09.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was... the Monkey's Paw!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.11,0:10:16.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Blaming the assault of your classmates on the Monkey's Paw distorting your wish,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.32,0:10:19.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,or claiming that it wasn't what you intended, is just an excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.79,0:10:21.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But Oshino...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.12,0:10:26.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you wondering what real proof I have that lets me say that, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.88,0:10:29.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious when you listen to her story?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.50,0:10:32.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened to that arm of yours when you were in elementary school, young lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.18,0:10:37.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't realize it until the next day, when you went to class
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.10,0:10:40.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and only those four seats were empty, isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.18,0:10:44.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If, at that time, your left arm had ended up like it is now,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.02,0:10:48.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you probably would've realized something had happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.31,0:10:51.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you didn't include anything of that sort in your story, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.40,0:10:56.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which means that the aberration came one night without you noticing,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.07,0:11:02.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,latched itself onto your arm, and beat up your classmates, fulfilling your wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.79,0:11:07.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And without you noticing, the aberration separated from your arm and left.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.50,0:11:10.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It probably grew from a hand to an arm
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.75,0:11:15.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,using a portion of your soul that was taken in exchange for granting your wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.63,0:11:17.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Oshino, that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.47,0:11:24.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Believing the attacker's excuse, you really are a nice person, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.06,0:11:27.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not surprising that she'd be jealous enough
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.77,0:11:31.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to want to kill the guy who took away her beloved senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.77,0:11:35.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When she attacked you, it wasn't against her intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.15,0:11:40.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She intended to attack you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.33,0:11:49.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.39,0:12:09.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.35,0:12:12.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Took you longer than expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.69,0:12:16.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't really know how much is too much...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.11,0:12:18.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It might not even be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.49,0:12:21.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But this way's better than having her take too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.99,0:12:24.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Both for me... and for Shinobu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.83,0:12:30.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Since you're about to have a big fight with a demon, Araragi-kun,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.38,0:12:34.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd say it's not the best time to be thinking too much like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.88,0:12:40.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're really close to your limit, but I still don't think you have a good chance of winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.89,0:12:43.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if your opponent is only going to use her left arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.93,0:12:48.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A contract, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.93,0:12:51.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's fine as long as the demon just goes back to the spirit world afterward.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.98,0:12:55.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'll be fine. I can at least guarantee that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.44,0:12:59.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If the contract can't be fulfilled, then it becomes void, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.78,0:13:04.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It also becomes void if the demon can't grant the young lady's wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.03,0:13:08.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So basically, if I'm not killed by the devil, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.33,0:13:09.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.54,0:13:16.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course, even if you power up by giving Shinobu-chan as much of your blood as you can,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.42,0:13:20.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Compared to during spring break when you were still a vampire,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.55,0:13:23.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think you can draw forth more than a tenth of the power you did then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.39,0:13:27.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's quite the number.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.39,0:13:31.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so, you can't just borrow Shinobu-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.94,0:13:34.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you do, it'll be more than just a bluff...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.15,0:13:37.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We really will have to chop off the young lady's arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.15,0:13:40.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Exterminating it means something because you're doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.32,0:13:48.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll keep an eye on your bag and valuables, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.20,0:13:50.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'll be hard to move if you're carrying them, won't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.00,0:13:53.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.29,0:13:54.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.22,0:14:03.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could you tell me one thing, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.22,0:14:05.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.26,0:14:09.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to save someone who tried to kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.68,0:14:16.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if it was unconsciously, that young lady chose you as her hated rival in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.36,0:14:26.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When you realized it was her in the raincoat, why did you decide to talk to her about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.16,0:14:32.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should've ignored her and come straight to me when that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.12,0:14:37.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone hates someone at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.34,0:14:40.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think I'll pass on getting killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.21,0:14:49.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If looking up to Senjougahara is the reason Kanbaru hates me, I can forgive that. {could be split into two lines}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.31,0:14:56.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see. Well, if that's what you've decided, then so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.23,0:15:00.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't care. It's none of my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.53,0:15:04.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now then, Araragi-kun.\NGo help the young lady out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.28,0:15:10.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just so you know, once you go in, you can't come out until it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.62,0:15:14.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The door won't open from the inside, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.29,0:15:20.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And of course, if anything does happen, neither I nor Shinobu-chan will come to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.29,0:15:21.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.38,0:15:22.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.59,0:15:24.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.38,0:15:27.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No worries. {i like this. :)}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.90,0:15:38.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.29,0:16:00.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Kanbaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.51,0:16:05.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is it working?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.72,0:16:16.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She can use not only her left arm, but her legs too?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.94,0:16:25.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1\q3}Not only does the Rainy Devil left arm want to attack me, but Kanbaru herself, too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.94,0:16:28.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Unconsciously, Kanbaru is rejecting it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.95,0:16:30.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's rejecting that her wish won't come true.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.03,0:16:32.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That I won't be killed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.87,0:16:35.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kanbaru has no intention of giving up on Senjougahara.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.58,0:16:39.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, cut it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.38,0:16:43.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't need this left arm...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.71,0:16:45.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.88,0:16:47.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.17,0:16:49.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,0,655,1448)}What about basketball?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.84,0:16:53.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I tried to kill a person!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.85,0:16:55.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a small price to pay in comparison.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.85,0:16:57.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, Kanbaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.68,0:17:00.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, I don't care about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.19,0:17:02.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're going to cut it off, I know a good way to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.27,0:17:10.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you use Shinobu-chan's blade, it's possible to cut off that arm so fast you won't even feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.70,0:17:15.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even with Shinobu-chan in her current state, cutting off a thin arm like that is a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.78,0:17:16.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth, Oshino!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.49,0:17:18.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kanbaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.95,0:17:21.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not something to worry so much about, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.58,0:17:24.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no reason for you to feel responsible at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.17,0:17:27.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Monkey's Paw...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.96,0:17:30.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,no, this aberration called the Rainy Devil is what did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.47,0:17:32.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The aberration only granted her wish, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.84,0:17:36.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She made the wish, and it granted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.64,0:17:39.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wasn't it the same with Tsundere-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.81,0:17:43.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't care, Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.10,0:17:46.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have to care! There's no way you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.44,0:17:47.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.90,0:17:50.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And what are you going to do about Senjougahara?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.90,0:17:52.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I... want you and Senjougahara to...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.11,0:17:54.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.62,0:17:57.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't care anymore, not even about Senjougahara-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.33,0:18:01.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't care.\NI give up, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.42,0:18:14.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.17,0:18:14.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru Suruga!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.18,0:18:17.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,HATE! HATE!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.17,0:18:46.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like you've been enjoying yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.14,0:19:01.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Having fun without me, are you?\NHow thoughtless, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.43,0:19:04.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Senjougahara....
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.44,0:19:08.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did Oshino use my phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.23,0:19:14.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, you lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.91,0:19:23.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You tricked me by saying you hit a telephone pole, and you hid everything about Kanbaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.62,0:19:26.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't we promise not to do that when we started going out?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.37,0:19:34.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not to keep secrets like that from each other, no matter how small?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.34,0:19:35.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.13,0:19:37.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you 10,000 times over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.10,0:19:44.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But really, Araragi-kun, it looks like you've already died 10,000 times or so...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.43,0:19:47.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll forgive you just this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.69,0:19:56.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You weren't really stupid enough to think that if you died,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.70,0:20:01.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the entire problem would be solved, were you, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.62,0:20:05.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.54,0:20:10.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you died, I'd obviously do everything in my power to kill Kanbaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.08,0:20:14.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, are you trying to turn me into a murderer?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.55,0:20:18.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She saw right through it.{\i0}\N{\i1}Really, she's so understanding...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.05,0:20:27.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What really disgusts me most, though, is that even if you didn't have that body,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.27,0:20:32.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know you would have thrown yourself at this problem in just the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.86,0:20:38.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you did these stupid things simply because you knew you could rely on your immortal body,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.28,0:20:41.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I would just tell you to do as you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.37,0:20:48.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But Araragi-kun, the way you just jump into these things like it's the obvious response... I just don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.50,0:20:53.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, be it a terrible burden, an unncecessary intrusion, an unasked favor,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.13,0:20:57.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it might not be too bad if it's you who's doing it, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.43,0:21:06.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1\q3}Let's say that one plan was to defeat the demon and make it impossible for the hidden part
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.39,0:21:08.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1\q3}of Kanbaru's wish to be fulfilled...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.81,0:21:13.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1\q3}but revealing to Senjougahara that Kanbaru really wanted to kill me, making it impossible{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.86,0:21:18.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}for the other side of her wish to be fulfilled was another plan, as well.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.99,0:21:25.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1\q3}What's more, Senjougahara swore right in front of the demon that she'd kill Kanbaru if Kanbaru killed me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.78,0:21:27.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It couldn't get away with feigning ignorance.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.91,0:21:32.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To the Rainy Devil, the decision had already been made.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.08,0:21:35.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't believe you saw through all that, Oshino.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.63,0:21:39.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.97,0:21:41.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,even when compared to a demon, are one magnificent bastard.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.13,0:21:45.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, Kanbaru.\NI'm glad you're well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.90,0:21:58.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I love you, Senjougahara-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.94,0:22:01.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know.\NI don't really love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.45,0:22:04.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will you stay by my side despite that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.74,0:22:08.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry I kept you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.49,0:22:12.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Man, even being the fall guy has its good points.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.12,0:22:15.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was like I had a comic role written just for me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.63,0:22:23.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1\q3}Even though I of all people should've known how greedy and what a sore loser Senjougahara Hitagi is.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.51,0:22:29.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If it really was so important, there's no way she'd give up on it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.52,0:22:31.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Butting in.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.93,0:22:34.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Being nosy.{\i0}\N{\i1}Doing unwelcome favors.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.44,0:22:38.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But, well...{\i0}\N{\i1}How should I put it?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.86,0:22:43.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Both of them are really hard to deal with.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.58,0:22:50.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nii-chan! Come on, it's morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.37,0:22:52.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You gotta get up already! {"You gotta" gives it a more kiddy approach"}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.66,0:22:53.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.50,0:22:59.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mornin', Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.67,0:23:04.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Kanbaru-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.47,0:23:06.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.59,0:23:13.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara-senpai called this morning and asked me to come meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.39,0:23:15.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me grab your bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.48,0:23:16.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, let's go, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.52,0:23:20.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, what about your club?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.48,0:23:23.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you have practice on Sundays?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.57,0:23:27.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The break before exams is coming, so you have to get serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.66,0:23:30.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I can't play basketball anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.58,0:23:33.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It may be a bit early, but I'm quitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.58,0:23:35.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's really only half-done, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.25,0:23:39.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The demon left, but in the end my arm didn't go back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.63,0:23:44.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's really no way I can keep playing basketball with my arm like it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.22,0:23:49.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But in any case, it is pretty powerful and easy to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.89,0:23:52.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give my bag back, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.52,0:23:57.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Karen!\NI'm Tsukihi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.35,0:23:58.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On the subject of Koyomi, he's more than just our brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.85,0:23:59.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bro, you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.81,0:24:01.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you know about Sanninbou? {Is explained later}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.31,0:24:02.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sanninbou?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.40,0:24:06.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a certain date on which some believe building a house will cause a great fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.53,0:24:07.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,destroying three neighboring houses!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.53,0:24:08.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a frightening belief!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.61,0:24:10.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As expected of the brother of the fire sisters!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.53,0:24:12.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just as expected of our brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.41,0:24:15.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But check this out, it's a textbook method to get away with murder!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.16,0:24:16.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What kind of recipe?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.08,0:24:18.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The criminal is one who uses Sanninbou!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.37,0:24:20.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A license to kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.37,0:24:21.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With - or without - a reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.38,0:24:22.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Postview quiz!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.29,0:24:23.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Postview?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.21,0:24:25.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Last time Suruga Monkey Part Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.13,0:24:25.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.05,0:24:27.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Next time! Nadeko Snake, Part One!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.22,0:24:29.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's Sen-chan's turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.63,0:24:30.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't push it.
